# INBOX is case-insensitive also as the first level of a hierarchical name (RFC 9051 section 5.1)
C: A1 CREATE inbox.sub
S: A1 OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] CREATE completed\.

C: A2 LIST "" "*"
SUB {
S: \* LIST \(\\HasChildren\) "\." "INBOX"
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) "\." "INBOX\.sub"
}
S: A2 OK LIST completed\.

C: A3 STATUS inbox.sub (MESSAGES)
S: \* STATUS "INBOX\.sub" \(MESSAGES 0\)
S: A3 OK STATUS completed\.

C: A4 SELECT Inbox.sub
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\Seen\)
S: \* 0 EXISTS
S: \* 0 RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(\\Answered \\Deleted \\Draft \\Flagged \\\Seen( \\\*)?\)\].*
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT 1\].*
S: A4 OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed\.

C: A5 CLOSE
S: A5 OK CLOSE completed\.

C: A6 RENAME inbox.sub inbox.renamed
S: A6 OK RENAME completed\.

C: A7 DELETE inbox.renamed
S: A7 OK DELETE completed\.

C: A8 LIST "" "*"
S: \* LIST \(\\HasNoChildren\) "\." "INBOX"
S: A8 OK LIST completed\.
